# Obsidian vault config for the `docs/` knowledge base.
#
# Strategy: share the configuration that shapes the *team's* Obsidian experience
# (link format, graph color groups, core plugin toggles), but ignore the
# per-machine state that diverges between contributors.
#
# See docs/DOCS_CONVENTIONS.md for the docs/ directory contract.

# --- Shared (committed): .obsidian/{app,graph,core-plugins,appearance}.json ---
# --- Per-user (ignored) below ---

# Workspace layout — window positions, open tabs, scroll state. Per-machine.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Community plugin binaries + their local data. realclaudian ships a bundled
# agent plugin; its main.js + session data are per-user, not team config.
.obsidian/plugins/
.obsidian/community-plugins.json

# Obsidian internal caches.
.obsidian/.cache
.obsidian/cache

# Claudian plugin local state (user settings, chat session history).
.claudian/
